Package: com.jiaying.gamehalltweak
Name: Jiaying GameHall Tweak
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS peripheral-to-touch mapping core for mobile games. Supports Bluetooth/USB keyboards, mice and gamepads with customizable key mappings, floating control panel and in-game touch injection.
Maintainer: Jiaying Dev <dev@example.com>
Author: Jiaying Dev
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5100), preferenceloader
Conflicts: com.jiaying.gamehalltweak.rootless
